# panel-champion-chamber 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel
# (Class F1): the seal panel of ev_champion, index 7 — after
# Vale's last words, before the flag that seals the ending.
# Original in-house art, generated deterministically by
# w10c-rig/gen-panels-t2.mjs. Brief = the HALL_OF_FAME
# record: "The doors close behind you. The chamber is round,
# quiet, and older than the League itself. One by one, your
# team's names are etched into the light." The round chamber:
# closed doors with their seam of light, the scored dais, six
# name plates beaming up around the ring of light at its heart.
PIX panel-champion-chamber 128 80
